/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Some properties have the same location and description, but their rental prices are very different. In the Aribnb dataset collected on July 14, 2026, 1558 listings in Downtown with available price data had nightly prices ranging from $7.96 to $5277.6, representing a prices range of $5269.64. This happens because hosts use different pricing strategies, change prices based on demand or season, or set different minimum stay rules. These price differences can create unusual numbers \(outliers\) that make calculating average prices and revenues less accurate.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
